      "message": "I just uploaded a follow up patch which uses the client APIs.\n\nThis is primarily used in the shutdown/reboot path. Init will pause the snapshot-merge threads during shutdown.\n\nPost device reboot, merge threads will automatically resume when the daemon is spin up.\n\nThere is no use case to pause/resume the snapshot-merge apart from device reboot.",
